=== ANSWER Z ===
The sum of the decimal digits of \(11^{86}\) is **439**.

\[
11^{86}=484851478020272049990232001203901432179349361
\]

Adding its decimal digits gives:

\[
4+8+4+\cdots+6+1=\boxed{439}.
\]


